That's not challenger, right?

00:22:21.831 --> 00:22:22.870
The idea of being a challenger

00:22:22.870 --> 00:22:25.180
is a mindset and a mental
approach to kind of disrupt,

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.500
think of things a little bit
differently in an industry,

00:22:27.500 --> 00:22:28.660
