00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:44.920
You can get there.

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:46.720
Having a challenger mindset,

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:48.960
when you have a brand the size of Pepsi,

00:22:48.960 --> 00:22:49.793
which is probably bigger

00:22:49.793 --> 00:22:52.670
than 99% of the other
consumer brands in the world,

00:22:52.670 --> 00:22:54.210
a little bit more tricky.

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:55.043
