you to host the Super Bowl.

00:26:45.060 --> 00:26:46.740
And so we came up with this concept

00:26:46.740 --> 00:26:48.220
called the Cola truce.

00:26:48.220 --> 00:26:50.700
And it's a pretty fun
also kind of instigative

00:26:50.700 --> 00:26:52.920
challenger thing we ended up doing where,

00:26:52.920 --> 00:26:55.070
essentially for anyone
who's been to Atlanta,

00:26:55.070 --> 00:26:58.410
