00:27:01.790 --> 00:27:03.800
And right out in front
of the World of Coke

00:27:03.800 --> 00:27:06.830
is a statue of their
founder, John Pemberton.

00:27:06.830 --> 00:27:08.740
He's holding out a glass of Coke,

00:27:08.740 --> 00:27:10.010
