00:27:10.010 --> 00:27:11.640
you know, sharing a Coke with the world,

00:27:11.640 --> 00:27:13.880
and all that great stuff.

00:27:13.880 --> 00:27:15.980
And so, quite literally, we said,

00:27:15.980 --> 00:27:20.610
what if we created a statue
of our founder, Caleb Bradham,

00:27:20.610 --> 00:27:22.503
and we got them to, you know,

00:27:22.503 --> 00:27:24.250
have a nice little cheers moment,

00:27:24.250 --> 00:27:26.600
and celebrate and declare a Cola truce.

00:27:26.600 --> 00:27:27.550
Wouldn't that be a cool thing?

00:27:27.550 --> 00:27:29.620
And so what we ended up doing is we,

00:27:29.620 --> 00:27:32.730
we built this statue, in
record time by the way,

00:27:32.730 --> 00:27:34.820
'cause this was just a couple
weeks out of the Super Bowl,

00:27:34.820 --> 00:27:38.598
